Input to Vertex Shader:
1. Look up Input Assembler Vertex Buffer Layout
   - This is how you tell HLSL how the variables are packed in your VSInput struct
   - DX11 has Input slots, a way to bind different vertex buffers should you want to put some attributes non contiguously
   
2. You can also pull VertexID and look up the buffer yourself

